  "subdivision_of_building": "Front facing top floor flat. Three windows.  The building is a grade II listed building.",
  "status": "Application Under Consideration",
  "description": "I wish to change the three (all) of my property's windows. They are crittall windows and rusting very badly. I cannot close one of them and this is causing high gas bills. I've obtained a quote (like for like window replacement) and the work needs to start promptly. There will be no change of use. I simply wish to repair my flat. My property is residential owner occupied and for private residential use.  I cannot stress the urgency of a prompt response. I applied for planning permission in 2022 and the application was accepted but lapsed in 2025, because i didn't  have the funds to complete the works. I will to replace my windows with the same crittal windows (with the same aesthetics but the new winows will be made of aluminium) The outside character of the building will not change in terms of style an aesthetics.  ",
